    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 22-layer planar multilayer filter on CaF2 (Daimon-20) substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence: ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat) (22 coating layers). Initialize thicknesses at: [909.4, 804.2, 708.0, 683.0, 344.8, 1221.0, 362.2, 576.3, 876.3, 627.6, 371.9, 1154.2, 336.7, 467.5, 850.9, 419.4, 829.2, 1274.1, 929.2, 420.9, 806.8, 881.9] nm (iteration-16 best candidate). Constrain each thickness to ±15 nm around these center values. Optimize for: maximize mean transmittance in 3250-3350 nm and 4200-4300 nm bands; minimize mean transmittance in 2500-3100 nm and 4450-5000 nm bands. Use coherent transfer matrix method. Normal incidence, unpolarized. No metal layers. Total layer count fixed at 22.",
